WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two recordings can sound different. Which part of a result belongs to the sound?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A 2025 study tested recorded clinical hypnosis against white noise labeled hypnosis.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Both groups improved. The hypnosis group improved more on the main six-week comparison.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The medical outcome was hot flashes—not instant concentration, and not Zen12.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before you buy an audio routine, examine the exact format and the evidence for its promise.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the source, try a free baseline, and decide without a miracle claim.
